@format 1
@id export.restore-modifications
@title Restore preset modifications
@area Export
@entry input
@summary Discard tab-specific output changes by reapplying the selected preset.
@flow TB
@related export.commit-modifications, export.apply-preset

@alias export = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PExport

[input] Restore requested <input>
- Receive the modified preset's cancel command @ export.PExportModificationRestore(...)
> restore

[restore] Reapply preset <process>
- Replace tab-specific state with the selected preset @ export.PExportPresetApply(...)
- Refresh summary and modified indication @ export.PExportPresetSync(...)
> result

[result] Modifications discarded <output>
= Current output state again matches the selected preset.
